### Temu Webhook 接口测试

@temuAccessToken = replace-with-temu-access-token

### 更新 Webhook 事件订阅
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/webhook/events/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "permitEventCodeList": [
    "bg_order_status_change_event",
    "bg_trade_logistics_address_changed",
    "bg_aftersales_status_change",
    "bg_cancel_order_status_change"
  ],
  "cancelEventCodeList": []
}
